# RCLK_RCLK_XIPHY_INNER_FT: the CMT column's clock row (frame column 0x32,
# window in tilegrid.windows). From designs/kv260_cmt_char (60 specimens,
# 561 track observations, no exception): a used west-side HDISTR track
# CLK_HDISTR_ZERO<k> sets 02_<46-2k>, an east-side CLK_HDISTR_ONE<k>
# 03_<46-2k>. The crossing pip ONE<k> <-> ZERO<k> adds 03_<47-2k> one way and
# 02_<47-2k> the other; nextpnr drops this tile's pips (gen/filters.py), so
# only the USED bits are written.
RCLK_RCLK_XIPHY_INNER_FT.WIRE.CLK_HDISTR_ZERO0.USED.V1 add-feature 02_46
RCLK_RCLK_XIPHY_INNER_FT.WIRE.CLK_HDISTR_ONE0.USED.V1 add-feature 03_46
